niture Polish bottle is placed back on the table, standing out against the shiny, polished wood.]\\n\\nVoiceover: \\\"Radiance Furniture Polish \\u2013 because your home deserves nothing less.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to black with the Radiance logo and contact information.]\\n\\n[End of advert.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4o-2024-05-13\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\": 411}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720799487, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kCqND5P2IqjucC6Mai51IHQXBbEh\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a washing machine\", \"response\": \"**[Scene: A bright, modern kitchen. A family is bustling around, preparing for the day. The camera focuses on the sleek, new washing machine in the corner.]**\\n\\n**Narrator (Voice Over):** \\nIntroducing the future of laundry... [Brand Name] Washing Machine!\\n\\n**[Cut to a close-up of the washing machine as the door opens effortlessly. A mother, Sarah, loads in a pile of clothes.]**\\n\\n**Sarah:** \\nThis washing machine has changed the way we do laundry. It\\u2019s so easy and efficient!\\n\\n**[Cut to a digital display panel lighting up with intuitive controls and various settings.]**\\n\\n**Narrator (Voice Over):**\\nWith cutting-edge technology, our washing machine offers a range of customizable settings to suit all your laundry needs.\\n\\n**[Cut to a shot of Sarah selecting a setting and pressing 'Start'. The machine hums quietly.]**\\n\\n**Narrator (Voice Over):**\\nWhisper-quiet operation means you can run it anytime, day or night, without disturbing your home.\\n\\n**[Cut to a split-screen showing different loads being washed: delicate fabrics, a heavy blanket, and a normal mixed load.]**\\n\\n**Narrator (Voice Over):**\\nWhether it\\u2019s delicate silks, heavy-duty blankets, or everyday wear, our washing machine handles it all with care.\\n\\n**[Scene transitions to the father, Tom, taking out freshly washed clothes and holding up an impeccably clean shirt.]**\\n\\n**Tom:**\\nLook at this! No more