ding with a terrace overlooking the 18th green. Golfers are seen relaxing and enjoying drinks on the terrace.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"After your round, unwind at our luxurious clubhouse. Enjoy fine dining at our restaurant, relax with a drink on the terrace, or browse the latest gear in our pro shop.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a friendly staff member greeting a family at the clubhouse entrance.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"At Oakwood, we pride ourselves on our warm hospitality and exceptional service. Whether you're here for a casual round, a tournament, or a special event, our staff is dedicated to making your visit memorable.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a shot of a golf instructor giving a lesson to a young golfer on the driving range. The instructor is patient and encouraging.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"And for those looking to improve their game, our experienced instructors offer personalized lessons tailored to your needs.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to a wide shot of the entire golf course, bathed in the golden light of the setting sun. The camera slowly zooms out to reveal the full beauty of the landscape.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Discover the perfect blend of challenge and tranquility at Oakwood Golf Club. Come for the game, stay for the experience.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to the Oakwood Golf Club logo, along with contact information and a website URL.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Book your tee time today at OakwoodGolfClub.com. Oakwood Golf Club\\u2014where every shot is a memory.\\\"\\n\\n[Soft music plays as the screen fades to black, and the tagline appears: \\\"Oakwood Golf Club: Your Game, Your Escape.\\\"]\\n\\n[End of advert.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4o-2024-05-13\", \"prompt_tokens\": 17, \"completion_tokens\": 569}, {\"unix_timestamp\": 1720799687, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-9kCtbpd76UjLfSLPBrD80gwZF7CKJ\", \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting therapy\", \"response\": \"[Scene: A serene, sunlit room with soft instrumental music playing in the background. The room is tastefully decorated with comfortable chair