eep breath, looking relieved.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"But what if you could escape to your own personal oasis... right at home?\\\"\\n\\n[The woman adds a few drops of bubble bath liquid into the running water. The camera zooms in on the bottle, showcasing the brand name and logo: \\\"Tranquil Bliss Bubble Bath.\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Introducing Tranquil Bliss Bubble Bath \\u2013 your ticket to relaxation.\\\"\\n\\n[The woman steps into the bathtub, and the camera captures her face lighting up with a smile as she sinks into the bubbles.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Infused with natural essential oils and nourishing ingredients, Tranquil Bliss transforms your bath into a haven of peace and tranquility.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to close-ups of the bubbles, the woman gently running her fingers through the water, and the steam rising, filling the room with a calming ambiance.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Feel the stress melt away as the soothing scent of lavender and chamomile envelops you.\\\"\\n\\n[The woman closes her eyes, leaning back against a soft bath pillow. The camera captures her serene expression.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Whether it's a moment of solitude after a long day or a weekend indulgence, let Tranquil Bliss Bubble Bath be your escape.\\\"\\n\\n[Cut to the woman stepping out of the bath, looking refreshed and rejuvenated. She wraps herself in a plush towel and smiles at her reflection in the mirror.]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Because you deserve a moment of pure bliss.\\\"\\n\\n[The screen fades to the Tranquil Bliss Bubble Bath bottle with a tagline beneath: \\\"Tranquil Bliss Bubble Bath \\u2013 Find Your Serenity.\\\"]\\n\\nNarrator: \\\"Available at all major retailers. Treat yourself today.\\\"\\n\\n[The music softly fades out as the screen transitions to the brand logo and website: www.tranquilblissbath.com]\\n\\nNarrator (whispering): \\\"Tranquil Bliss \\u2013 where relaxation begins.\\\"\\n\\n[End scene.]\", \"model\": \"gpt-4o-2024-05-13\", \"prompt_tokens\": 16, \"completion_tokens\